Copyright (c) 2025 TradingView, Inc.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Full licence text: assets/LICENSE-lightweight-charts.txt
Source: https://github.com/tradingview/lightweight-charts

The Apache-2.0 licence for this component carries an attribution requirement:
TradingView must be identified as the creator of the charting library, and a
link to https://www.tradingview.com/ must be present on the user-facing page.

QuantDesk satisfies this through the library's built-in `attributionLogo`
chart option, which renders the TradingView mark and link on each chart pane,
and through the attribution line in the application footer and README.

DO NOT disable `attributionLogo` or remove the footer attribution without
providing the required TradingView link somewhere else on the page — doing so
would breach the licence.

